      "content": "The fire's dying light mirrors the fading hope in your eyes, and it is time to let go of the weight you've carried since the first map was wrong. You are a butcher now, not a commander, and there is no honor in a life built on the blood of those you failed to protect. The only way to find peace in this ruined tent is to end the suffering you inflict on yourself and the world you've broken.",
